WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:17.954
Eddy and his friends were playing.

2
00:00:17.955 --> 00:00:27.300
Jeb chased Poppy.

3
00:00:27.301 --> 00:00:32.880
Zippy zoomed by.

4
00:00:32.881 --> 00:00:40.967
"You're all slow!" he said.

5
00:00:40.968 --> 00:00:46.419
Ms. Fender came outside.

6
00:00:46.419 --> 00:00:49.612
"Come here, everyone!" she called.

7
00:00:49.613 --> 00:00:52.455
"I have some news!"

8
00:00:52.456 --> 00:00:56.480
Everyone hurried over.

9
00:00:56.480 --> 00:00:59.627
"What is it?" Dipper asked.

10
00:00:59.628 --> 00:01:03.536
"Field trip tomorrow!" Ms. Fender said.

11
00:01:03.536 --> 00:01:10.520
"Someone will do something amazing!"

12
00:01:10.521 --> 00:01:14.066
"I'll bet it's a race," Zippy said.

13
00:01:14.066 --> 00:01:17.949
"Someone will go fast!"

14
00:01:17.949 --> 00:01:24.198
Zippy zoomed around the parking lot.

15
00:01:24.199 --> 00:01:27.709
"No, Zippy," Ms. Fender said.

16
00:01:27.709 --> 00:01:34.374
"We're not going to a race."

17
00:01:34.374 --> 00:01:38.871
"Will someone build something?" Jeb asked.

18
00:01:38.871 --> 00:01:42.073
"Nope," Ms. Fender said.

19
00:01:42.073 --> 00:01:46.380
"Will a car do jumps?" Gasser asked.

20
00:01:46.381 --> 00:01:51.307
"Nope," Ms. Fender said.

21
00:01:51.308 --> 00:01:54.645
"What is it then?" Eddy asked.

22
00:01:54.645 --> 00:01:58.191
"Tell us!" Poppy cried.

23
00:01:58.192 --> 00:02:01.162
Ms. Fender grinned.

24
00:02:01.162 --> 00:02:06.563
"Someone will say good-bye!"

